Package: bobine
Version: 2.0.1
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: FantasmaGlad <fantacasino3012@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: 106012
Depends: ffmpeg
Recommends: avahi-daemon
Homepage: https://bobine.fit
Description: Video and audio playout system for gym studios
 Bobine is an autonomous multi-channel playout solution (wired HDMI video,
 network screen, background radio, mobile remote and web administration)
 designed for boutique gyms and fitness studios.
 .
 * **Editeur :** FantasmaGlad
 .
 * **Site web officiel :** https://bobine.fit
